==Important events==
{{spoilers}}
* [[Carr]] attempts, and fails, to usurp the leadership of [[Team Rocket]].
* {{adv|Mewtwo}} is freed from its armor.
* {{adv|Red}} and {{adv|Blue}} receive their new [[Pokédex]]es.
* {{adv|Giovanni}} is revealed to be {{adv|Silver}}'s father. [[Sird]] and [[Orm]] kidnap Silver in order to take him to their leader.
* Red and Mewtwo battle Giovanni and {{adv|Deoxys}} on top the Team Rocket airship.
* Silver finds out who his father is.
* {{adv|Yellow}} reaches the airship.
* {{p|Mew}} heads towards [[Kanto]].
* Mewtwo defeats Deoxys.
* The Kanto region's climate is restored.
* It is revealed that there are two Deoxys organisms. The origins of the second organism are revealed.
* The reason behind the kidnapping of Silver and {{adv|Green}} by the [[Masked Man]] is revealed.
* Carr attempts to kill everyone on board the airship.
* Sird manages to stabilize the airship.
* {{adv|Yellow}} tells {{adv|Red}} the rest of {{adv|Deoxys|Organism No. 2}}'s history. {{tt|*|VIZ release only}}
* {{adv|Blue}} helps {{adv|Silver}} acknowledge that {{adv|Giovanni}} is his father. {{tt|*|VIZ release only}}
* Red gives Yellow his old [[Pokédex]]. {{tt|*|VIZ release only}}
* Organism No. 2 goes off to find Organism No. 1. [[Sird]] tries to capture it. {{tt|*|VIZ release only}}
* Red, Blue, {{adv|Green}}, Yellow, and Silver are turned to stone. {{tt|*|VIZ release only}}

